// Depot's words, in English. Change a label here, not in the code; Depot reads this table when it starts. %s is
// filled in by Depot, in order. TextKeys.cs names every key, and a test checks the two agree. Write in the Venture
// Design Language's voice: say what happened, plainly and calmly, and give a remedy only when the reader couldn't
// work it out.

// The window's title
app name ^Depot^
title document ^%s^
title document edited ^%s (edited)^

// The title bar
bar menu tip ^Menu^
bar undo ^Undo^
bar undo tip ^Undo the last change (Ctrl+Z)^
bar redo ^Redo^
bar redo tip ^Redo what was undone (Ctrl+Shift+Z)^
bar add ^Add ▾^
bar add tip ^Add a control or a part of the window^
bar look tip ^The Hudini theme the canvas draws in^
bar no appearance ^No Appearance ▾^
bar appearance ^Appearance: %s ▾^
bar appearance tip ^The Hudini appearance documents are read with, as a game reads its windows^
window minimize ^Minimize^
window maximize ^Maximize^
window restore ^Restore^
window close ^Close^

// The menus
menu file ^File^
menu edit ^Edit^
menu insert ^Insert^
menu arrange ^Arrange^
menu view ^View^
menu help ^Help^
item open ^Open…^
item new ^New^
item save ^Save^
item close window ^Close Window^
item quit ^Quit^
item undo ^Undo^
item redo ^Redo^
item duplicate ^Duplicate^
item delete ^Delete^
item bring forward ^Bring Forward^
item send backward ^Send Backward^
item look ^Look^
item appearance ^Appearance^
item choose appearance ^Choose an Appearance…^
item no appearance ^No Appearance^
item guide ^UIScript Guide^

// What Add and Insert offer besides controls, which go by their element's name
part picture ^Picture^
part toolbar item ^Toolbar Item^
part title field ^Title Field^

// The looks the canvas draws in
look depot ^Depot^
look depot light ^Depot Light^
look standard ^Hudini Standard^

// The panes
pane outline ^Outline^
pane inspector ^Inspector^
canvas no document ^No document open^
canvas no renderer ^Unable to locate depot-render. Try building and placing it beside Depot, or name it with %s.^
hint no document ^Open a document to see its elements.^
hint uis ^Can't edit .uis files.^
hint unreadable ^Hudini can't read the text as it is, so only the text can be edited: %s^
hint select ^Select an element to see its attributes.^

// The inspector
group identity ^Identity^
group frame ^Frame^
group text ^Text^
group appearance ^Appearance^
group behaviour ^Behaviour^
group other ^Other^
inspector other note ^Hudini doesn't read these; they're kept as written.^
inspector required ^%s: required^
inspector select first ^Select an element of a document Hudini reads first.^

// The status bar
status start ^Open a document.^
status uis ^Opened %s in read only mode.^
status saved ^Saved %s.^
status saved unreadable ^Saved %s, but Hudini won't read it as it is: %s^
status refused ^Hudini wouldn't read that: %s^
status appearance refused ^Depot can't use the appearance %s: %s Keeping %s.^
status appearance refused none ^Depot can't use the appearance %s: %s Reading documents without one.^
status unsaved failed ^Couldn't ask about unsaved changes: %s^
status picture unreadable ^Couldn't read depot-render's picture: %s^
status guide failed ^Depot couldn't open %s in a browser.^
status ignored ^Hudini ignores %s.^
status missing images ^Images not found, outlined in red: %s.^
status missing string ^1 string shows its table and index, since Depot doesn't read string tables yet.^
status missing strings ^%s strings show their table and index, since Depot doesn't read string tables yet.^
status uis part ^1 part of the .uis file Hudini can't represent.^
status uis parts ^%s parts of the .uis file Hudini can't represent.^
status size ^%s × %s.^
status size tab ^%s × %s, showing the %s tab.^
status size pane ^%s × %s, showing the %s pane.^
status size tab pane ^%s × %s, showing the %s tab and the %s pane.^

// Choosing files
choose document ^Open a Document^
choose appearance ^Choose a Hudini Appearance^
files interface ^Interface documents^
files uix ^UIScript^
files uis ^Maxis interface scripts^
files appearance ^Hudini appearances^

// Unsaved changes
unsaved title ^Unsaved Changes^
unsaved question ^Save the changes to %s?^
unsaved note ^If you don't, they're lost.^
unsaved save ^Save^
unsaved dont save ^Don't Save^
unsaved cancel ^Cancel^
unsaved this document ^this document^

// Documents
document missing ^There's no file at %s.^
document too large ^%s is %s bytes; Depot opens documents up to %s.^
document unreadable ^Couldn't read %s: %s^
document not utf8 ^%s isn't UTF-8, which UIScript documents are.^
document unsaved ^Couldn't save %s: %s^

// depot-render
renderer failed before ^This conversation with depot-render has already failed.^
renderer timed out ^depot-render didn't answer within %s seconds.^
renderer lost ^Depot lost touch with depot-render: %s^
renderer said ^%s It said: %s^
renderer cant start ^Couldn't start depot-render at %s: %s^
renderer unreadable answer ^depot-render answered with something Depot can't read: %s^
renderer empty answer ^depot-render answered with neither a picture nor an error: %s^
